WEBVTT

00:02:28.978 --> 00:02:31.272
Hundreds more have been wounded.

00:02:32.398 --> 00:02:33.566
Ten years ago,

00:02:33.566 --> 00:02:36.944
I dedicated myself
to building world-class schools

00:02:36.986 --> 00:02:38.613
for the children of Ukraine.

00:02:39.614 --> 00:02:42.742
I believe education
is the most powerful tool

00:02:42.742 --> 00:02:44.994
for improving the economy,

00:02:44.994 --> 00:02:47.830
the environment and human well-being.

00:02:48.497 --> 00:02:51.792
War very quickly destroys all three.

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:56.797
So far, 900 schools
have been critically damaged.

00:02:56.839 --> 00:02:59.383
84 are completely destroyed.